      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "(Frustrated User)\n\nThe Prismic Avatar world has the ability to request to be Blacklisted  off their search results which I am fine with, because I have avatars that are hidden in the are map that are meant to be rewards for completions and what they do with it after is their own.\n\nBut we have another avatar search world that does not give you any info to be blacklisted and which I am passionately not happy with that.\n\nJust to highlight the future of Avatars. Just IMAGIN Our Avatar World category 3 freakin Rows be nothing BUT Avatar Search World.\n\nScary thought but can happen.",
