  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-18T07:00:47.517Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The main thing preventing me from uploading public avatars due to lack of avatar search, is the fact that basically anyone ripping your avatar ID can upload it in any world they create with or without permission so long as the avatar is listed as public.\n\nAwfully funny this never comes up in arguments justifying the need for an avatar search honestly. Theres worlds full of others' avatars put there without the creators' permission and its kinda just permitted by the sdk.🤔 \n\nCan we please require that world uploads require some form of verification before uploading our work and taking traffic from our avatar worlds?",
